cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "pkg_visualizer: 3-D Visualization of Python Packages"
abstract: >
  pkg_visualizer parses a Python package's abstract syntax tree and renders
  its classes, methods and functions as an interactive 3-D scene built with
  PyVista and PyQt5. Elements can be filtered, picked to show their
  docstrings, and exported to HTML, PNG or JPG, from the GUI or headless.
  A multi-arch container image serves the GUI to a browser through noVNC.
